              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidha kukugha abaidhukulu kamaala, bafuuke eighanga ery'amaani. Ndidha kukugha enkabi, era ndeetere eriina lyo okumanhikana olwo lighange okugheesanga abandi enkabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
