          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye olw'okuba kyabazinga yatwala Sarai, Musengwa Katonda yaamusindikira endwaire embi einho ghalala n'abantu ab'omu kisaagaati kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga yaayeta Aburamu, yaamubuuza ati: “Kiki kino ky'onkoze? Lwaki tiwankobeire oti ono mukazi wo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwaki wankobye oti ono mwanhoko, n'ondeka okumutwala nga mukazi wange? Kale ni, mukazi wo wuuyo, mutwale era ogolole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga yaalagira abasaadha be baafulumya Aburamu mu nsi eyo, ghalala ni mukazi we era n'ebintu byonabyona bye yali nabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.20",
